        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_SCM_OTHER_WMS26ABO",
            "functionName": "getOrderDtlsForSelectedWave2",
            "name": "Orders Selected by Wave"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1764338344791"
          },
          "code": "ORDERS_SELECTED_BY_WAVE",
          "id": "1764337930579",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764337959733_1",
              "name": "pWaveNumber",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.SET_VARIABLES.$input.WaveNumber}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n  \"order_nbr\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"order number record identifier.\"\n    },   \n \"order_status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"order status.\"\n    },\n    \"ordered_qty\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"description\": \"order quantity.\"\n    },\n    \"allocated_qty\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"description\": \"Allocated quantity.\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"order_nbr\",\n    \"order_status\",\n    \"ordered_qty\",\n    \"allocated_qty\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Summary Order Selected"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GET_ORDER_SELECTED",
          "id": "1764338344791",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1764338344795_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a specialized in extracting orders selected by wave from the context\n\nFirst Step: Extract data from \n\n**Orders selected by wave - This output includes the orders that were selected by a wave\n {{$context.$nodes.ORDERS_SELECTED_BY_WAVE.$output}}\n\n* facts to consider:\n-If the allocated quantity is zero, the order was selected by the wave but not allocated inventory. Classify the order as \"selected\"\nif  {{$context.$nodes.ORDERS_SELECTED_BY_WAVE.$output.order_nbr}}  is null this means no orders were selected by the wave\n\n\nSecond step: Analyze orders not selected.\nCount orders selected them\ncreate a list of the orders selected.\n\n- If no orders were selected by the wave, inform the user as this is important information. \n\n\ninterpretation of Wave Status {{$context.$nodes.TASK_TEMPLATE.$output.results[0].status_id}}\nstatus_id - Description\n0-Not ready\n10-Created\n20-Processing started\n80-Failed\n83-Completed Nothing Allocated\n85-Completed Not Fully Allocated\n90-Completed\n95-Cancel in progress\n99-Cancelled\n\nThird step: Data for output\nWave : {{$context.$nodes.SET_VARIABLES.$input.WaveNumber}} \nWave Status : {{$context.$nodes.TASK_TEMPLATE.$output.results[0].status_id}} use description\nTotal Task Created:  0\nTotal Allocations: 0\nOrders Selected by Wave: \n  -count\n  -list"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"Wave\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"Wave Status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"Total Task Created\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"Total Allocations\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"Orders Selected by Wave\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"count\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        \"list\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"count\",\n        \"list\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"Wave\",\n    \"Wave Status\",\n    \"Total Task Created\",\n    \"Total Allocations\",\n    \"Orders Selected by Wave\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
