              "value": "**Roles:\n-Extract  data from Allocations\n {{$context.$nodes.ALLOCATIONS_CREATED.$output}} \nThis output includes all the allocations that were created by wave\n\nInterpretation of allocation status\n\nstatus_id - Description\n0-Allocated\n30-Processing started\n90-Completed\n99-Cancelled\n\n**extra info\nDo not add reference about status_id on the output\n\nOutput:\nWave : {{$context.$nodes.SET_VARIABLES.$input.WaveNumber}} \nTotal Task Created:  0\nTask Template on wave : {{$context.$nodes.TASK_TEMPLATE.$output.results[0].task_creation_id.key}} if null , mention Empty\nAllocations : Breakdown  by {{$context.$nodes.ALLOCATIONS_CREATED.$output.results[0].type_id.key}} provide count"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"Wave \": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n \"Total Task Created\": { \"type\": \"integer\" },    \n \"Task Template on wave\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n\"Allocations breakdown\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"Wave\",\n    \"Total Task Created\",\n    \"Task Template on wave\",\n   \"Allocations breakdown\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        }
